#: src/ui/settings.rs:2673
msgid "When both changed"
msgstr "Quando ambos mudaram"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2679
msgid "Moving a playlist or folder in Sirensong custom order moves it in your Spotify library too, and changes made in Spotify's apps come here. Albums, artists, podcasts, Liked Songs and Local Files are arranged only in Sirensong."
msgstr "Mover uma playlist ou pasta na ordem personalizada do Sirensong também a move na sua biblioteca do Spotify, e as mudanças feitas nos apps do Spotify chegam aqui. Álbuns, artistas, podcasts, Músicas Curtidas e Arquivos locais são organizados só no Sirensong."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2686
msgid "When Sirensong custom order and your Spotify library were both rearranged apart: show both and choose, take Spotify's, or keep this computer's and send it to Spotify."
msgstr "Quando a ordem personalizada do Sirensong e sua biblioteca do Spotify foram reorganizadas separadamente: mostrar as duas e escolher, usar a do Spotify, ou manter a deste computador e enviá-la ao Spotify."

#. Translators: When both orders changed: show both and choose each time.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2705
msgid "Ask me"
msgstr "Perguntar"

#. Translators: When both orders changed: take the Spotify library's.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2707
msgid "Spotify's"
msgstr "O do Spotify"

#. Translators: When both orders changed: keep Sirensong custom order.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2709
msgid "Mine"
msgstr "O meu"

#. Translators: {name} is a folder name in Sirensong custom order.
